            <div xml:id="m-39e27fd0-a1b0-483c-9eb1-70920bedcd67">
              <lg xml:id="m-a10f9f52-4e4d-454f-a96c-4f28f198fb2b">
                <l xml:id="m-0699ed7f-d52d-4880-9152-25a64041a179" facs="#m-452edf97-2c0f-423d-9a9e-46cb7c67a5ba" label="ambiguous">1210</l><l xml:id="m-5d4a47cd-aa7d-42d0-8bb7-74af9ce25b2f" facs="#m-9307f988-8b9a-405e-94f6-64ea047902ff" label="text-like">Common of Virgins. Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-4263d92a-b124-4115-980d-3c295e536855" facs="#m-4817b942-2426-4c7f-8b28-fa619f104a2f" label="lyrics-like">At Prime. Ant. Haec est Virgo sâpiens, et úna. as below. Psalms ce</l><l xml:id="m-e11b1174-d349-4d2a-8e15-b9e668e92030" facs="#m-3b70f808-001d-41eb-b9ab-359f51f533d1" label="lyrics-like">on Feasts. Short Lesson. Dómine Deus meus. oquam pulchra est.</l><l xml:id="m-e63fd71f-def0-46c1-a731-26de532671b4" facs="#m-37f1a8ab-f7c8-441d-be6a-51b183912598" label="text-like">as below at None.</l><l xml:id="m-b51483ad-9502-4ba6-a72c-31a9dfccc17d" facs="#m-34b13954-55f4-4335-963b-2a8b3eef9e2e" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-f3ef331e-1a84-4f2d-a9d6-ce2ebc190297" facs="#m-ad674f5b-f117-4d56-a560-3bbecf464765" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Haec est Virgo sápiens, quam Dóminus. as below. Psalms of</l><l xml:id="m-2222a852-3162-41ac-afd4-4e5290ea08dc" facs="#m-b6613e2a-e922-44e8-b855-bef73d1cd2a7" label="lyrics-like">Sunday. Chapter from Vespers. Fratres: Qui gloriátur. D. 12.</l><l xml:id="m-a3d6727d-d861-41a3-af35-2fcfc72679bf" facs="#m-47531b69-85e7-417b-918d-ed6aaf78ebed" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Spécie túa. D. 1256. V. Adjuvábit éam.</l><l xml:id="m-95baf66e-6a9d-4e63-bb35-91d9e54f99ba" facs="#m-77ec7009-0498-4015-8cca-12257bcff606" label="text-like">The Masses are found after the and Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-1115baf7-3b63-4b71-8c28-e2cb307f38f4" facs="#m-6287f132-538b-42e3-be8d-d669a6ec317e" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-24b14a90-f01f-4c52-91ef-9cafe75eb70e" facs="#m-e5dc993a-f062-4ae9-a33c-103d2f04604e" label="text-like">Ant. Haec est. p. 1211. Psalms of Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-c786ff49-5db5-4eb6-8fd9-5744519527a2" facs="#m-d2d5e866-cfcc-41a2-bc77-b422a7004f5c" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-0478b69b-3951-4a90-8184-4188d30e3f4d" facs="#m-6e158c5a-9575-4512-9680-840eb045635e" label="ambiguous">2. Cor. 11.</l><l xml:id="m-c731710d-8fa6-484f-8db6-644f653b42cc" facs="#m-ee252cb4-db4a-459d-8b0b-9d8f265b416b" label="lyrics-like">(Emulor enim vos Dei aemula-luni viro, * vírginem castam exhi¬</l><l xml:id="m-904b0d78-13ee-4dea-820d-b3ba02f159e7" facs="#m-2fb900a2-f106-440e-86fb-7be34572676e" label="lyrics-like">A tióne. f Despóndi enim vosl bére Christo.</l><l xml:id="m-9e38a622-4cdb-4ff6-b36b-9c22348ee98e" facs="#m-b9db450e-583e-4c84-b175-bce15d643607" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Adjuvábit éam. D. 12V. Elégit éam.</l><l xml:id="m-c85a8fa4-9338-48d2-9679-ca102f0aadce" facs="#m-92502787-e0a8-4c42-999a-7892dd333e5e" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-10c6120f-90f7-43e5-9607-3bbf90f12434" facs="#m-d326c6a6-a539-4e15-aad0-e5f535f9b02c" label="text-like">Ant. Ista est. p. 1211. Psalms of Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-0f9a24d4-e085-430c-b537-8c4bf98e4e22" facs="#m-0531536a-fa54-4f45-8843-9e48e209fc05" label="text-like">For a Virgin Martyr. Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-7b042010-f052-460d-aa3c-c167502d642b" facs="#m-4ee8a16f-ab2f-4622-942a-e5d6cf3bd3cd" label="ambiguous">Eccli. S1. b.</l><l xml:id="m-67df205d-4a3f-4b62-a75a-a2b9259453a2" facs="#m-55df5e37-4b95-4427-ae83-aa7807bbda05" label="lyrics-like">Omine Deus meus, exaltásti su-¡Dómini mei, ut non derelínquat</l><l xml:id="m-93b06544-9085-41d4-9b43-7c8ff4075aab" facs="#m-0308fa1a-9925-41c1-8de2-06c7b761dd37" label="lyrics-like">I per terram habitatiónem meam, me in die tribulatiónis meae, 4 et</l><l xml:id="m-3ec6896e-48c9-4b34-8397-ebc8c4f450e9" facs="#m-0ed8d23d-1b51-4400-83b3-acad66250aea" label="lyrics-like">in témpore superbórum sine adju¬</l><l xml:id="m-45327de3-9cdb-429a-b2a4-5c3d3dc0cce1" facs="#m-f8cb9d87-7b82-422d-9bf6-65e1f3eb711c" label="lyrics-like">et pro morte defluénte deprecáta</l><l xml:id="m-a8744003-02d5-4630-a567-4bb764ab364b" facs="#m-8fcf4896-1e02-4193-a003-eac2e4d37187" label="lyrics-like">sum. T Invocávi Dóminum Patrem l tório.</l><l xml:id="m-bb0d2878-bc89-4f0e-9b20-f2802063abb0" facs="#m-f980d924-5e9d-4b34-9051-2cf9901777c6" label="text-like">For a Virgin not a Martyr. Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-bbb44bd2-934f-48b2-b580-e7b7118f32f5" facs="#m-cf0b5041-74e0-4267-bd49-fa122ab8fb29" label="ambiguous">Sap. 4.</l><l xml:id="m-587066bf-130e-47e9-b1f3-c45ec4a3fc5e" facs="#m-658e6510-7da6-42f6-aa34-32add5ee3f21" label="lyrics-like">Quam pulchra est casta gene-] quóniam apud Deum nota est, et</l><l xml:id="m-099fffe4-2e36-447f-99bb-cda00a7c0e22" facs="#m-dea14f0a-018e-4194-86fd-ea2a7f5bca27" label="lyrics-like">U rátio cum claritáte! t immor- apud hómines.</l><l xml:id="m-024caa6d-4cb7-43bd-a1b5-70cfeaa12c85" facs="#m-a4d9f444-3ad5-42d0-95c6-c856ae05bd2b" label="lyrics-like">tális est enim memória illíus:</l><l xml:id="m-c3d299a4-eadf-4ea0-af01-30f76a683a4d" facs="#m-cec96d82-853b-4544-999f-627c61ad6302" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Elégit éam. p. 1258. v. Diffúsa est.</l><l xml:id="m-690c84b3-fec5-4768-927f-b49f7c251b03" facs="#m-58fb31cf-ebf2-4d65-b6b1-6f3947b5ad64" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-b6a44257-1b04-4208-a8b2-b1536217e757" facs="#m-01428970-2b1c-46b4-a120-cb78d507f282" label="lyrics-like">Paalms. 1. Dixit Dóminus. 1. f. p.128. — 2. Laudáte púeri. 1. f. p. 148.</l><l xml:id="m-06d9a133-9eb0-4290-a26a-7ed4143015c1" facs="#m-5662543e-0955-41b1-9f1b-9753c6d74625" label="lyrics-like">— 3. Laetátus sum. 3 a p. 170. — 4. Nisi Dóminus. I. f. p. 175.</l><l xml:id="m-0e5d2f48-50c3-4162-8c00-385e8dfbf480" facs="#m-36dbe64e-f1f7-4159-81b4-cb2005f457e9" label="lyrics-like">— 5. Láuda Jerúsalem. 3. a. p. 203.</l><l xml:id="m-7ae80626-26ef-48e1-b9bc-5fa673b009d7" facs="#m-fc65c462-2831-4ad6-a6a3-4f13cb861610" label="ambiguous">1.Ant.4</l><l xml:id="m-d57b8102-96e8-4b18-b664-9f380f0a01be" facs="#m-f579da6b-fae3-42aa-aeca-2f78bab500f2" label="ambiguous">1.f</l><l xml:id="m-48d3dc02-64b4-43e5-a46c-f810689ef9fd" facs="#m-5848e751-67a2-4647-97a9-d77a775f47de" label="lyrics-like">Aec est Virgo sápi-ens, “ et úna de número pru¬</l><l xml:id="m-a10ec8e7-8140-4b62-b0f3-e0b028167ad4" facs="#m-c5505bef-e1f8-4a7a-9d99-a41920332fc0" label="ambiguous">2.Ant</l><l xml:id="m-ae9cd501-9036-41ae-ae07-c475dc73c9ac" facs="#m-1143b7db-b3d2-4b66-818b-735512895158" label="ambiguous">1.i</l><l xml:id="m-67f8da99-9c3a-4200-ab48-aaf54895ac02" facs="#m-893d9b65-2dad-4b1e-8472-aadfd840851a" label="ambiguous">R Aec est</l><l xml:id="m-8e8d5486-e50a-4d55-af57-e9e3b191b6a5" facs="#m-97c9fa72-060a-4b14-8912-fea047d14dc3" label="lyrics-like">déntum. T. P. Alle-lú-ia. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-fb755a5d-d39a-4a57-a0ef-6c9d40e585de" facs="#m-da014c4f-9f8e-4bec-8354-8fe9ad9a2360" label="lyrics-like">Virgo sápi-ens, * quam Dómi-nus</l><l xml:id="m-7169bdf6-5de2-4124-925c-23372b80ec84" facs="#m-9edf3abd-aab0-4d36-986b-fc8126609bba" label="lyrics-like">vi-gilántem invé-nit.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
